    {
      "id": 27,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        0,
        760
      ],
      "size": [
        1440,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## FLUX 3 Image Klein + SeedVR2, tuned for a 12 GB Arc B580\n\nType a short request in **Prompt**. The prompt upsampler expands it into the full scene caption Klein needs (BFL: never run Klein without one). The caption is shown in **Caption sent to the model**; turn **Use prompt upsampler** off to send your own caption verbatim.\n\nKlein (distilled, 15 steps, cfg 1) renders at about 1 MP and that image is saved as is, then SeedVR2 7B restores and doubles it to about 2048 px in one step, colour-matched to the base. The upsampler is deterministic, so rerolling the image seed reuses the cached caption and skips the LLM.\n\n### Files (under `/data/models/`)\n\n| Folder | File | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| diffusion_models | flux3-image-klein-int8-convrot.safetensors | 5.8 GB |\n| text_encoders | qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors | 4.9 GB |\n| text_encoders | qwen3.5_9b_flux3_prompt_upsampler_w4a8.safetensors | 6.7 GB |\n| vae | flux2-vae.safetensors | 0.3 GB |\n| diffusion_models | seedvr2_7b_int8_convrot.safetensors | 8.3 GB |\n| vae | seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors | 0.5 GB |\n\nThe first four come from [black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy) (gated: accept the license first), the last two from [Comfy-Org/SeedVR2](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2).\n\n### Knobs\n- Aspect ratio: any preset in **Base resolution**. Keep megapixels near 1.0: Klein's sweet spot, and 2x of it is what SeedVR2 fits in 12 GB.\n- Every file loads completely on 12 GB. The bf16 Klein (11.1 GB) and the int8 upsampler (9.8 GB) would load only partially, which on Arc tends to end in `UR_RESULT_ERROR_OUT_OF_RESOURCES`.\n- Upscale out of memory: `seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors` (3.5 GB). Crisper: the `seedvr2_7b_sharp_` variant, which can over-sharpen AI images.\n- Comparing settings: set the KSampler seed to `fixed`, otherwise every run is a different image.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
